   322		Fix an admissible tuple $\mathsf{qldparams} = (q,m,d)$ (Definition~\ref{def:admissible}) and let $M = 2^m$. Answers in the game $\mathfrak{G}^{\mathrm{Pauli}}_{\mathsf{qldparams}}$ take the following forms, depending on the question type; answers not of the prescribed form are rejected.
